Now it is afternoon in Mexico.
My family is eating cake.
It is a big chocolate cake.
My little sister, Sofía, smiles.
"Look, Maya!" she says.
She holds a piece up to the screen.
It is a big piece.
"Oh, Sofía," I say.
"That cake looks very delicious."
I smile.
"Now I am hungry!" I say.
My mother and father laugh.
Sofía and Diego laugh too.
We all laugh together.
